# Textbooks (RAG) Rules

## Ingestion must be idempotent
- Re-running ingestion should not duplicate records.
- Persist stable chunk IDs and metadata.

## Chunk metadata (required)
Store per chunk:
- book title, edition, author
- license
- chapter/section headings
- page range (if PDF)
- source path / URL (if applicable)

## MCP server tools (stable surface)
Expose minimal stable tools:
- `textbooks.search(query, filters)` -> top chunks + metadata
- `textbooks.read(chunk_id)` -> content + metadata
- `textbooks.cite(chunk_id)` -> formatted attribution/licensing info

## Citations
- Never paste large verbatim sections; summarize + short excerpt if needed.
- Always return “Sources” locators for textbook-based claims.
